{
  "version": "2.1.0",
  "$schema": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/oasis-tcs/sarif-spec/main/sarif-2.1/schema/sarif-schema-2.1.0.json",
  "runs": [
    {
      "tool": {
        "driver": {
          "fullName": "Docker Scout",
          "informationUri": "https://docker.com/products/docker-scout",
          "name": "docker scout",
          "rules": [
            {
              "id": "CVE-2020-28500",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2020-28500: Inefficient Regular Expression Complexity"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2020-28500?s=github&n=lodash&t=npm&vr=%3E%3D4.0.0%2C%3C4.17.21",
              "help": {
                "text": "All versions of package lodash prior to 4.17.21 are vulnerable to Regular Expression Denial of Service (ReDoS) via the `toNumber`, `trim` and `trimEnd` functions. \n\nSteps to reproduce (provided by reporter Liyuan Chen):\n```js\nvar lo = require('lodash');\n\nfunction build_blank(n) {\n    var ret = \"1\"\n    for (var i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n        ret += \" \"\n    }\n    return ret + \"1\";\n}\nvar s = build_blank(50000) var time0 = Date.now();\nlo.trim(s) \nvar time_cost0 = Date.now() - time0;\nconsole.log(\"time_cost0: \" + time_cost0);\nvar time1 = Date.now();\nlo.toNumber(s) var time_cost1 = Date.now() - time1;\nconsole.log(\"time_cost1: \" + time_cost1);\nvar time2 = Date.now();\nlo.trimEnd(s);\nvar time_cost2 = Date.now() - time2;\nconsole.log(\"time_cost2: \" + time_cost2);\n```\n",
                "markdown": "> All versions of package lodash prior to 4.17.21 are vulnerable to Regular Expression Denial of Service (ReDoS) via the `toNumber`, `trim` and `trimEnd` functions. \n\nSteps to reproduce (provided by reporter Liyuan Chen):\n```js\nvar lo = require('lodash');\n\nfunction build_blank(n) {\n    var ret = \"1\"\n    for (var i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n        ret += \" \"\n    }\n    return ret + \"1\";\n}\nvar s = build_blank(50000) var time0 = Date.now();\nlo.trim(s) \nvar time_cost0 = Date.now() - time0;\nconsole.log(\"time_cost0: \" + time_cost0);\nvar time1 = Date.now();\nlo.toNumber(s) var time_cost1 = Date.now() - time1;\nconsole.log(\"time_cost1: \" + time_cost1);\nvar time2 = Date.now();\nlo.trimEnd(s);\nvar time_cost2 = Date.now() - time2;\nconsole.log(\"time_cost2: \" + time_cost2);\n```\n\n|                                                                                                       |\n|Package                                                                        pkg:npm/lodash@4.17.20  |\n|Affected range                                                                 >=4.0.0,<4.17.21        |\n|Fixed version                                                                  4.17.21                 |\n|[[CVSS Score 5.3] [CVSS Vector CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:L]]                          |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "affected_version": ">=4.0.0,<4.17.21",
                "cvssV3": 5.3,
                "cvssV3_severity": "MEDIUM",
                "cvssV3_vector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:L",
                "fixed_version": "4.17.21",
                "purls": [
                  "pkg:npm/lodash@4.17.20"
                ],
                "security-severity": "5.3",
                "tags": [
                  "MEDIUM"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "CVE-2025-13465",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2025-13465: Improperly Controlled Modification of Object Prototype Attributes ('Prototype Pollution')"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2025-13465?s=github&n=lodash&t=npm&vr=%3E%3D4.0.0%2C%3C%3D4.17.22",
              "help": {
                "text": "### Impact\n\nLodash versions 4.0.0 through 4.17.22 are vulnerable to prototype pollution in the `_.unset` and `_.omit` functions. An attacker can pass crafted paths which cause Lodash to delete methods from global prototypes. \n\nThe issue permits deletion of properties but does not allow overwriting their original behavior.  \n\n### Patches\n\nThis issue is patched on 4.17.23.\n",
                "markdown": "> ### Impact\n\nLodash versions 4.0.0 through 4.17.22 are vulnerable to prototype pollution in the `_.unset` and `_.omit` functions. An attacker can pass crafted paths which cause Lodash to delete methods from global prototypes. \n\nThe issue permits deletion of properties but does not allow overwriting their original behavior.  \n\n### Patches\n\nThis issue is patched on 4.17.23.\n\n|                                                                                                                              |\n|Package                                                                                               pkg:npm/lodash@4.17.20  |\n|Affected range                                                                                        >=4.0.0,<=4.17.22       |\n|Fixed version                                                                                         4.17.23                 |\n|[[CVSS Score 6.9] [CVSS Vector CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:L/SC:H/SI:H/SA:H/E:P]]                          |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "affected_version": ">=4.0.0,<=4.17.22",
                "cvssV3": 6.9,
                "cvssV3_severity": "MEDIUM",
                "cvssV3_vector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:L/SC:H/SI:H/SA:H/E:P",
                "fixed_version": "4.17.23",
                "purls": [
                  "pkg:npm/lodash@4.17.20"
                ],
                "security-severity": "6.9",
                "tags": [
                  "MEDIUM"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "CVE-2021-23337",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2021-23337: Improper Neutralization of Special Elements used in a Command ('Command Injection')"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2021-23337?s=github&n=lodash&t=npm&vr=%3C4.17.21",
              "help": {
                "text": "`lodash` versions prior to 4.17.21 are vulnerable to Command Injection via the template function.\n",
                "markdown": "> `lodash` versions prior to 4.17.21 are vulnerable to Command Injection via the template function.\n\n|                                                                                                       |\n|Package                                                                        pkg:npm/lodash@4.17.20  |\n|Affected range                                                                 <4.17.21                |\n|Fixed version                                                                  4.17.21                 |\n|[[CVSS Score 7.2] [CVSS Vector CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:H/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H]]                          |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "affected_version": "<4.17.21",
                "cvssV3": 7.2,
                "cvssV3_severity": "HIGH",
                "cvssV3_vector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:H/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H",
                "fixed_version": "4.17.21",
                "purls": [
                  "pkg:npm/lodash@4.17.20"
                ],
                "security-severity": "7.2",
                "tags": [
                  "HIGH"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "version": "1.20.0"
        }
      },
      "results": [
